/Author (Wenxin Li) /CreationDate (D:20260505132355+00'00') /Creator (Wenxin Li) /Keywords (Coordination Knowledge Substrate, CKS, determinism contract, substrate determinism, representation determinism, model-output determinism, LLM non-determinism, five guarantees, regression testing, AI-as-substrate-mediator, source of truth, path retraceability, defensive publication, prior art, Wenxin Li) /ModDate (D:20260505132355+00'00') /Producer (ReportLab PDF Library - \(opensource\)) 
  /Subject (Defensive publication: full operational treatment of the determinism contract introduced in the Coordination Knowledge Substrate \(CKS\) pattern. Establishes the integrating frame for the contract's decomposition: substrate-versus-model determinism boundary, five guarantees, allowed non-determinism, regression testing, and integrating-frame operational test.) /Title (The Determinism Contract: Full Operational Treatment of Substrate Determinism, Model Non-Determinism, and the Five Guarantees That Distinguish Them in CKS) /Trapped /False
